      "transcriptHtml": "\n<details>\n<summary>\n<i></i>\n<span>Xem Bản gỡ băng Lời thoại (Task 1: Lan &amp; Tom) - Đã mở khóa</span>\n</summary>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Tom:</strong> Hi Lan! Why do come to school so early today?</p>\n<p><strong>Lan:</strong> Hi Tom! <mark>I always get up early at 5.30 a.m., do some morning exercise and go to school at 6.30 a.m.</mark></p>\n<p><strong>Tom:</strong> Wow! It’s a good habit to keep fit but I’m too lazy for it because <mark>I often stay up late to watch films. I often get up quite late at 6.15 a.m. except today when my dad has to travel on business.</mark></p>\n<p><strong>Lan:</strong> Watching films is also a good hobby! <mark>Films help us learn more about different cultures.</mark> They also teach us how to behave or react in some special situations. For example, what to do when there is a fire or an earthquake.</p>\n<p><strong>Tom:</strong> That’s true. But <mark>I think I’ll need to arrange my schedule so that I can get up earlier for morning exercise.</mark> I want to look as great as you!</p>\n<p><strong>Lan:</strong> Thank you, Tom! Good health surely helps us study better.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n"
