    "<p>12 câu</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>A</span>\n<div>\n<h2>PART A: LISTENING (2.4 POINTS)</h2>\n<p>Mỗi câu đúng x 0.2 điểm • Đĩa CD tự chạy 2 lần</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span>12 câu • 2.4đ</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Task I: Tom and Lan -->\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>\n              I. Listen to the conversation between Lan and Tom. Circle the best answer A, B, or C. You will listen TWICE. (1.2 p)\n            </h3>\n<p>Bấm nút máy phát để nghe đoạn hội thoại giữa Lan và Tom.</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- Task 1 Transcript Locker -->\n\n\n<!-- Task 1 Questions -->\n\n<div>\n<!-- Q1 -->\n\n\n\n<!-- Q2 -->\n\n<!-- Q3 -->\n\n<!-- Q4 -->\n\n<!-- Q5 -->\n\n<!-- Q6 -->\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Task II: Healthy habits True/False -->\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>\n              II. Listen and tick true (T) or false (F) to the statement: (1.2 p)\n            </h3>\n<p>Bấm nút máy phát để nghe đoạn văn về Healthy Habits.</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- Task 2 Transcript Locker -->\n\n\n<!-- True/False Table -->\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>STT</div>\n<div>Statements (Nhận định)</div>\n<div>True (T)</div>\n<div>False (F)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<!-- Item 1 -->\n\n\n\n<!-- Item 2 -->\n\n<!-- Item 3 -->\n\n<!-- Item 4 -->\n\n<!-- Item 5 -->\n\n<!-- Item 6 -->\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
    "<p>13 câu</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>B</span>\n<div>\n<h2>PART B: LANGUAGE FOCUS (2.6 POINTS)</h2>\n<p>Ngữ âm, trọng âm, từ vựng, ngữ pháp và chia động từ</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span>13 câu • 2.6đ</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Part B.I: MCQ (10 questions x 0.2p) -->\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>\n            I. Choose the best word or phrase to complete the following sentences by circling A, B, C or D. (2.0 p)\n          </h3>\n<p>\n<em>Ví dụ:</em> 0. He _________ to Ha Noi last week. (A. go &nbsp; B. going &nbsp; <u>C. went</u> &nbsp; D. will go)\n          </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<!-- Q1: Pronunciation -ed -->\n\n<!-- Q2: Stress -->\n\n<!-- Q3: Preposition -->\n\n<!-- Q4: Collocation hobby -->\n\n<!-- Q5: Community service verb -->\n\n<!-- Q6: Health advice -->\n\n<!-- Q7: Communication response -->\n\n<!-- Q8: Routine activity -->\n\n<!-- Q9: Sun protection -->\n\n<!-- Q10: Activity object -->\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Part B.II: Verb Forms (3 items x 0.2p) -->\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>\n            II. Give the correct form of the verbs. Write your answer in the provided blanks. (0.6 p)\n          </h3>\n<p>\n            Điền dạng đúng của động từ trong ngoặc (Đã hiệu chỉnh lỗi sai trong bản Word HDC).\n          </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<!-- Item 1 -->\n\n<!-- Item 2 -->\n\n<!-- Item 3: Corrected Word error \"are giving\" -> \"catches\" -->\n\n</div>\n</div>",
    "<p>10 câu</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>C</span>\n<div>\n<h2>PART C: READING (2.6 POINTS)</h2>\n<p>Điền từ vào bài khóa &amp; Đọc hiểu chọn đáp án trắc nghiệm A, B, C</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span>10 câu • 2.6đ</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Task I: Cloze Test (5 x 0.2 = 1.0p) -->\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>\n            I. Circle the letter before the best answer to complete the passage. (1.0 p)\n          </h3>\n\n</div>\n<div>\n          Hobbies are activities we enjoy doing in our free time. They can be anything from collecting stamps to <strong>(1) _________</strong> sports. Hobbies bring us many benefits. First, hobbies help us relax and have fun. When we do something we love, we forget about our worries and stress. This makes us feel <strong>(2) _________</strong> and healthier. Second, hobbies can help us <strong>(3) _________</strong> new things and develop new skills. For example, if you like to cook, you can learn new recipes and techniques. This can be a fun and rewarding way to spend your time. Third, hobbies can help us meet new people and make friends. When we <strong>(4) _________</strong> a club or group related to our hobby, we can meet people who share our interests. Overall, hobbies are a great way to enrich our lives and have <strong>(5) _________</strong>. Find a hobby you love and start enjoying the benefits today!\n        </div>\n<div>\n<!-- C1 -->\n\n<!-- C2 -->\n\n<!-- C3 -->\n\n<!-- C4 (Word typo fixed from A, C, C, D to A, B, C, D) -->\n\n<!-- C5 -->\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Task II: Reading Comprehension (1.6 points) -->\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>\n            II. Read the passage and do the task as directed. (1.6 p)\n          </h3>\n\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>\n            Each country has many good people who take care of others. For example, some of students in the United States often spend many hours as volunteers in hospitals, orphanages or homes for the elderly. They read books to the people in these places, or they just visit them and play games with them or listen to their problems.\n          </p>\n<p>\n            Other young volunteers go and work in the homes of people who are sick or old. They paint, clean up, or repair their houses, do the shopping. For boys who don’t have fathers, there is an organization called Big Brothers. College students and other men take these boys to basketball games or on fishing trips and help <u>them</u> to get to know things those boys usually learn from their fathers.\n          </p>\n<p>\n            Each city has a number of clubs where boys and girls can go and play games. Some of these clubs show movies or hold short trip to the mountains, the beaches, museums, or other places of interest. Most of these clubs use a lot of students as volunteers because they are young enough to understand the problems of younger boys and girls.\n          </p>\n</div>\n<!-- Subtask A: Converted from Typing to Multiple Choice for Mobile Convenience (3 x 0.4 = 1.2p) -->\n<div>\n<h4>\n            A. Multiple Choice - Đọc hiểu chọn đáp án A, B, C (1.2 p - Mỗi câu đúng 0.4 điểm)\n          </h4>\n<div>\n<!-- Q1 -->\n\n<!-- Q2 -->\n\n<!-- Q3 -->\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Subtask B: MCQ (2 x 0.2 = 0.4p) -->\n<div>\n<h4>\n            B. Choose the best option (0.4 p - Mỗi câu đúng 0.2 điểm)\n          </h4>\n<div>\n<!-- Q1 -->\n\n<!-- Q2 -->\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
    "<p>7 câu</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>D</span>\n<div>\n<h2>PART D: WRITING (2.4 POINTS)</h2>\n<p>Chạm chọn thẻ từ (Word Chips) để xếp câu hoàn chỉnh - Không cần gõ phím</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span>7 câu • 2.4đ</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Task I: Reorder Words (3 items x 0.4p = 1.2p) -->\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>\n            I. Put the following words and phrases in correct order to make sentences. (1.2 p - Mỗi câu đúng 0.4 điểm)\n          </h3>\n<p>\n<em>Hướng dẫn:</em> Chạm vào các thẻ từ trong khung xám (đã đảo lộn xộn) để đưa vào câu. Chạm vào từ trong câu để gỡ bỏ. Dấu câu do hệ thống tự xử lý.\n          </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<!-- Item 1 -->\n\n<!-- Item 2 -->\n\n<!-- Item 3 -->\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Task II: Rewrite sentences with Tap-to-Order Word Chips (4 items x 0.3p = 1.2p) -->\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>\n            II. Rewrite the sentences so that it has the same meaning as the first one. (1.2 p - Mỗi câu đúng 0.3 điểm)\n          </h3>\n<p>\n<em>Hướng dẫn:</em> Vế mở đầu đã được cho sẵn. Em chạm chọn các cụm từ xáo trộn để ghép phần còn lại thành câu đúng nghĩa.\n          </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<!-- Item 1 -->\n\n<!-- Item 2 -->\n\n<!-- Item 3 -->\n\n<!-- Item 4 -->\n\n</div>\n</div>"
